<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>گالری نقره نظمی</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:tahoma;
}

body{
background:#111;
color:white;
text-align:center;
min-height:100vh;
}

body::before{
content:"";
position:fixed;
top:0;
left:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
background:url('logo.jpg') center center no-repeat;
background-size:450px;
opacity:.05;
z-index:-1;
}

.header{
padding:40px 20px;
}

.logo{
width:180px;
height:180px;
margin:auto;
border-radius:50%;
overflow:hidden;
border:3px solid silver;
box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,255,255,.2);
background:white;
}

.logo img{
width:100%;
height:100%;
object-fit:cover;
}

h1{
margin-top:20px;
font-size:32px;
}

.card{
background:#1e1e1e;
max-width:500px;
margin:20px auto;
padding:20px;
border-radius:15px;
box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.btn{
display:block;
background:silver;
color:black;
padding:15px;
border-radius:12px;
text-decoration:none;
font-weight:bold;
margin-top:10px;
}

.footer{
padding:20px;
color:#aaa;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="header">

<div class="logo">
<img src="logo.jpg" alt="Nazmi Silver Gallery">
</div>

<h1>گالری نقره نظمی</h1>

</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>💰 قیمت روز نقره</h2>

<a class="btn"
href="https://nogreh.com/price-list/"
target="_blank">
مشاهده قیمت روز نقره
</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📞 تماس</h2>

<a class="btn" href="tel:09226619434">
09226619434
</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📷 اینستاگرام</h2>

<a class="btn"
href="https://instagram.com/silver_nazmi"
target="_blank">
@silver_nazmi
</a>
</div>

<div class="footer">
© Nazmi Silver Gallery
</div>

</body>
</html>
